Release-History:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

v 2.5:

- first major rework with some new features:
- User-selectable settings for:
   - number of colors
   - stretch display (try it out :-)
   - Character to display the pieces
   - inverse Character ??
   - keys to move pieces
- new score-calculation, speed no more score-related, but
  number_of_lines-related..
- uses User:First_Last/event.log to tell users when they've been
  pushed from place one :-)
- now the generating of the highscore-files should work under 1.3..


v 2.4:

- first official release, please spread it !!
- removed fatal bug that disabled the "Q" function and caused
  fantastic hiscores in minimal time :-)
- no known bugs this time...


v 2.3:

- improved input-handling for high-speed-modems
- improved Disk-Access-routines which caused DLG to lock up when
  trying to kick CONTRIS! off...
- this version has a bad bug which causes some very high scores :-)

v 2.2:

- corrected high.week and high.month update
- added DATE to Hiscores

v 2.1:

- first version with hiscore-tables

v 2.0 to 0.0:

- these were only for alpha-testing on Intuition-Base... (yes, I
  know, 01 for Amiga had one, too :-)
